1
00:00:03,961 --> 00:00:04,961
Are you okay?

2
00:00:06,881 --> 00:00:07,799
I can't leave you like this.

3
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:08,717
I will call the coach.

4
00:00:08,717 --> 00:00:09,843
Don't do anything stupid.

5
00:00:10,135 --> 00:00:11,135
What?

6
00:00:11,803 --> 00:00:12,803
I said don't do it!

7
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:15,223
Who do you think you are?

8
00:00:16,349 --> 00:00:16,975
Me?

9
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:18,183
I'm your captain.

10
00:00:18,935 --> 00:00:20,749
Do I just sit here when
my team mate is sick?

11
00:00:21,438 --> 00:00:22,438
Don't do anything.

12
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:24,441
I will get the couch
immediately.

13
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:27,402
Don't be so stubborn!

14
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:28,861
Don't do it.

15
00:00:30,071 --> 00:00:31,071
Plaese.

16
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:37,244
Okay.

17
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:38,370
At least

18
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:40,248
show me your injury.

19
00:00:40,832 --> 00:00:42,087
Show me your shoulder.

20
00:01:04,272 --> 00:01:06,107
I didn't see it last time
because it was dark.

21
00:01:06,775 --> 00:01:07,775
But as I see it now...
